e^{i\theta\boldsymbol\sigma_x}
&=e^{i\theta\lambda_+}\mathbf P_+ + e^{i\theta\lambda_-}\mathbf P_-\\
&=e^{i\theta}\mathbf P_+ + e^{-i\theta}\mathbf P_-\\
&=\cos\theta\,\mathbf I+i\sin\theta\,\boldsymbol\sigma_x\\
&=\begin{pmatrix}
\cos\theta&i\sin\theta\\
